WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.938
Zenuo, min ye Dagara fɔlɔ ye. Ale lo ye Ala ka danbaga ye.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.378
Zenuo tun ye jagokɛla ye. A tun b'o yiritu lɔn ka tɛmɛ mɔgɔ si kan.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.704
Fɛɛn dɔw koo la, u ye ɲɔgɔn sɔsɔ tugun.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.536
Dugumɔgɔw tun tɛ se ka bɛn u ka foro daan na tugun.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.728
O foro tɛ i ta ye!

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.652
An ka taga.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:46.900
An ka taga an ka dugukolo ɲini.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.656
Zenuo n'a muso Nyolé y'u ka minanw ta ani u ka wulu.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.232
U ye tile damani kɛ tagama la yiritu kɔnɔ.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.640
Wuladafɛ, u tun lɔnin be tasuma daa la ka lolow filɛ.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:44.176
Loon dɔ, baji belebeleba dɔ y'u bali ka taga.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.498
Zenuo ka kurun dɔ sogi; o tagara ji kan.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:08.842
K'an to baa kɔ fɛ, koo bɛɛ tun ye kura ye. U m'u ɲaa yɛlɛma.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:25.322
Nka, an be se ka lɔ yɔrɔ juman? Zenuo tun b'a fɛ ka tagamasiyɛn dɔ kɛ.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:32.384
O kɔ, o y'a daminɛ ka yiriba dɔ lamini.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:36.390
A be yan, Nyolé. A be yan.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:02.562
Zenuo y'a ta kalanw dan yiri jukɔrɔ. O be kɛ an ka sigiyɔrɔ fɔlɔ ye.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:13.568
O ka bon dɔ lɔ ɲɔgɔn fɛ, k'a kɛ kogo ye, ka foro fɔlɔ labɛn.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:39.152
O kɔ, denbaya wɛrɛw nana sigi yen.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:52.026
Deen dɔ wolola. Dugumɔgɔw tun y'a daminɛ.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.584
Lɔnnikɛla dɔ y'a fɔ ko Zenuw bɔnsɔnw lo sɔrɔla o la.
